{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_b1a3d526b10016c5-599\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>汪明荃（阿姐）與羅家英日前去「校長」譚詠麟的演唱會，二人換上一身亮眼的名牌情侶裝在內場恩愛自拍，甜蜜程度引得網民關注，紛紛留言大讚sweet爆！</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_b1a3d526b10016c5-599\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9b8ffaf1-446b-4f9c-b8de-aa612fa497af.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026RY9v70VMhI1789613633.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9b8ffaf1-446b-4f9c-b8de-aa612fa497af.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_b1a3d526b10016c5-600\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>阿姐對校長的演出讚不絕口：「與家英哥睇譚校長演唱會，唱足3小時，把聲非常靚，感情豐富，還有少少舞蹈，仲坐golf車繞場一周，近距離接觸觀眾，全場High爆。佩服佩服！」 相中可見，家英哥頭戴鴨舌帽，造型既潮又精靈；他還對鏡開心比V字手勢，與阿姐同框盡現默契。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_b1a3d526b10016c5-600\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_b1a3d526b10016c5-601\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>阿姐與家英哥結婚17年，依然恩愛如初。事實上，兩人過往曾多次穿情侶套裝甜蜜示人，而這套經典綠色格仔戰衣，亦在多個重要場合出現。除了名牌情侶裝之外，家英哥的鴨舌帽同樣出鏡率極高，獲不少網民讚他們不鋪張浪費，做到「貴買平著」。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_b1a3d526b10016c5-601\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ec2d09f8-065d-435e-9ae2-ef9347884838.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026bN0e3ZE1FP1789613633.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ec2d09f8-065d-435e-9ae2-ef9347884838.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3de9a7f0-6e3c-4b17-933a-8f40b2c37f03.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026hk936lr5zM1789613632.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3de9a7f0-6e3c-4b17-933a-8f40b2c37f03.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T03:20:02.450502+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":314,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}